{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/cEA6XbCS69sMPY_f16XvVQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:16.539934+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/cEA6XbCS69sMPY_f16XvVQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/ric67A1Sm2iaXzTZc6AcOoH8iaOysosZKibsiavrBXhPTJL3GUf15SEoep4TKUkicygpjfS01DtFlPBiaM8fee6DMibyibQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>为方便各位同学申报大连理工大学，研究生院已开通“大连理工大学接收推荐免试攻读研究生预报名系统”，网址为</span></span><span><span><span>https://yjszs.dlut.edu.cn/zsbm/logon</span></span></span><span><span>，详情可以查看</span></span><span><span><span>https://gs.dlut.edu.cn/info/1173/51492.htm</span></span></span><span><span>。</span><span>经济管理学院预报名时间为</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>25</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span><span><span>—</span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>16</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span>24</span></span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span><span><span>，请及时关注。</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>一</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>预推免报名要求</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/og5SzzpLtur4Pic3t5uw5s7VU45MSgTZUZ4ScxKO2veHiaZK4Fdngw7p5NwYs4Hy5dNZVc2eaia8IqfxuBWs1Ltibw/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1、我校接收推免生预报名系统的申请者须为预计能够获得本科所在高校</span><span><span>2027</span></span><span>年推荐免试资格的应届毕业生，未获得本科所在高校</span><span><span>2027</span></span><span>年推荐免试资格的申请者考核结果无效；</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2、申请者登录“我校接收推免生预报名系统”前须仔细阅读系统中的申请须知，并认真按照其要求完成申报；</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>3、通过考核的申请者须按照学院规定时间在“全国推免服务系统”中申报我校，未在规定时间申报者前期考核结果无效。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>二</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>预推免报名流程</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ric67A1Sm2iaXiaeFLB1INGibbIDtgaTB3rABxgJQvkUZOJrNTldYARgpEKEvJFdyByZgkx2NxIJ8l8XvM8ic35w0GA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ric67A1Sm2iaXiaeFLB1INGibbIDtgaTB3rAtCmqDsTeDqMkrBibpQeRibE5IYV6yNuWjvzxL29eriahLkKayEfCKbDEw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>申请者登录“大连理工大学接收推免生预报名系统” （https://yjszs.dlut.edu.cn/zsbm/logon）进行申请并查看审核进度， 需在系统中提交以下材料：</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（1）本科学习期间成绩证明；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）本科学习期间排名证明材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）六级成绩单或其它英语成绩证明复印件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）其他证明材料（如已发表论文、各类获奖或资格证书等）；其他科技创新类奖项获奖证明；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（5）个人简历。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>注：网报系统上传材料时注意事项</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>申请者需将待上传的证明材料以扫描或拍照的方式生成PDF文件或图像文件，命名方式为“考生姓名+材料名称”，例“刘某某+本科成绩证明”或“刘某某+本科排名证明”等，具体要求详见系统要求。</span></span></p><p><span><span>说明：若本通知与学校或上级单位发布的新规定不符，按照学校或上级单位发布的新规定执行。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ric67A1Sm2iaX47ToyrticE6PNF8ibgAE5GibXOAiaiaeEHqHxubicDXsKwF5AGQydRibtGSl1X53TpoWZCpKD9vQavO67g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span>内容来源 |</span><span> 教务办公室</span></span></section><section><span><span>编辑排版 |</span><span> 台怡</span></span></section><section><span><span>审核校对 |</span><span> 老祎 </span></span><span><span>杨楚甜 台怡</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https:/